524 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 179 0 R
/E (World models matter because they change what an AI is trying to do. Instead of matching new inputs to old examples, the system keeps a compact picture of its surroundings and asks what would follow from each choice. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [19]
>>
