/P 181 0 R
/E (Keywords: Large Language Models, Local AI, Small Language Models, Quantization, GGUF, llama.cpp, Edge AI, Private AI, Retrieval-Augmented Generation, Hybrid AI)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
