/E (Smaller models are likely to come alongside the rise of specialized AI hardware. Apple, Qualcomm \(Hexagon\), Intel and AMD \(XDNA\) are helping to bring dedicated AI acceleration to the more normal laptop and smartphone.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
620 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 184 0 R
/E (No Task is Entirely Cloud- or Local-Based Going forward, AI models will be segmented onto a hybrid multi-tier model, rather than a solely local or cloud model. Tasks that are relatively simple, privacy-critical and latency-sensitive will be performed locally on device. Tasks of intermediate complexity will be performed at the edge. Tasks that require frontier model capabilities will migrate into the cloud.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [6]
>>
